{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-37972" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the quotient of $3{x}^{3}-8$ divided by ${x}^{2}-1?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-37972" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Notice that the dividend is missing the ${x}^{2}$ and $x$ terms. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing terms with zero coefficients, as follows:\n\n$$\n3{x}^{3}-8=3{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x-8\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3x \\\\  & {x}^{2}-1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,3{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x-8\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}-3x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3x-8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is $3x,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $3x-8.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-37972" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6d29e521999cb9b472ce447c8a2168a0e18f4be689818cc62467116d706ad169"} {"question" "q-37972" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-37972" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-2x+3"] ["math" "-8"] ["math" "3x"] ["math" "4"] ["math" "5x-1"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-37972" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "3x"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-114492" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the remainder when  ${x}^{4}-2{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}-10x-7$ is divided by ${x}^{2}+2x+1?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-114492" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{2}-4x+3 \\\\  & {x}^{2}+2x+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,{x}^{4}-2{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}-10x-7\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{4}+2{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-4{x}^{3}-5{x}^{2}-10x-7 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,4{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}-4x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3{x}^{2}-6x-7 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{2}+6x+3}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,12x-10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is ${x}^{2}-4x+3,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $-12x-10.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-114492" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6d29e521999cb9b472ce447c8a2168a0e18f4be689818cc62467116d706ad169"} {"question" "q-114492" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-114492" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-10x+8"] ["math" "-12x-10"] ["math" "-6x+6"] ["math" "10x-5"] ["math" "2x-5"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-114492" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-12x-10"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-322924" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Express $\\frac{-8{x}^{4}+10{x}^{3}-27{x}^{2}+24x-4}{4{x}^{2}-3x+2}$ in the form $q(x)+\\frac{r(x)}{4{x}^{2}-3x+2},$ where $q(x)$ is the quotient and $r(x)$ is the reminder of the division.$$\n\n| $-8{x}^{4}+10{x}^{3}-27{x}^{2}+24x-4$ | __ | {{field-1}} | $+$ | {{field-2}} |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $4{x}^{2}-3x+2$ | __ |  |  | $4{x}^{2}-3x+2$ |" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-322924" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2{x}^{2}+x-5 \\\\  & 4{x}^{2}-3x+2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-8{x}^{4}+10{x}^{3}-27{x}^{2}+24x-4\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,\\,-\\,8{x}^{4}+6{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,4{x}^{3}-23{x}^{2}+24x-4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4{x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}+2x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,20{x}^{2}+22x-4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,20{x}^{2}+15x-10}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,7x+6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, \n\n- the quotient is $-2{x}^{2}+x-5,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $7x+6.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-8{x}^{4}+10{x}^{3}-27{x}^{2}+24x-4}{4{x}^{2}-3x+2} & =-2{x}^{2}+x-5+\\frac{7x+6}{4{x}^{2}-3x+2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-322924" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6d29e521999cb9b472ce447c8a2168a0e18f4be689818cc62467116d706ad169"} {"question" "q-322924" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-322924" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-2x^2+x-5"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-322924" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-322924" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "7x+6"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-325106" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the quotient of $-2{x}^{4}+11{x}^{3}-17{x}^{2}+3x+3$ divided by $-{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}-2x+1?$\n\nThe quotient is\n{{field-1}}." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-325106" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x-3 \\\\  & -{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}-2x+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-2{x}^{4}+11{x}^{3}-17{x}^{2}+3x+3\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,\\,-\\,2{x}^{4}+8{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}+2x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3{x}^{3}-13{x}^{2}+x+3 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{3}-12{x}^{2}+6x-3}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-{x}^{2}-5x+6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n- the quotient is $2x-3,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $-{x}^{2}-5x+6.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-325106" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6d29e521999cb9b472ce447c8a2168a0e18f4be689818cc62467116d706ad169"} {"question" "q-325106" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-325106" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "2x-3"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-325143" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the remainder of $-4{x}^{3}+16$ divided by $2{x}^{2}-3x+5?$\n\nThe remainder is\n{{field-1}}." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-325143" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Notice that the dividend is missing the ${x}^{2}$ and $x$ terms. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing terms with zero coefficients, as follows:\n\n$$\n-4{x}^{3}+16=-4{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x+16\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2x-3 \\\\  & 2{x}^{2}-3x+5\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-4{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x+6\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-4{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}-10x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-6{x}^{2}+10x+16 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,6{x}^{2}+9x-15}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,x+31\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is $-2x-3,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $x+31.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-325143" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6d29e521999cb9b472ce447c8a2168a0e18f4be689818cc62467116d706ad169"} {"question" "q-325143" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"} {"question" "q-325143" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "x+31"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065527/state.json" "file_sha256" "cd07d492090ebc6a2d006359e26e0e0a8a19a82793f31e2d1e44d259bb520b9a"}] "usage" {} "basis" 2169 "retractions" [] "immutable_answers" [] "immutable_fields" [] "no_history" []}
